menu "EPW statistics example"

    config EPW_STATS_WINDOW
        int "Rolling statistics window capacity"
        range 1 16
        default 8
        help
            Number of latest synthetic samples retained by the example.
            Storage is provided by app_main; changing this value requires
            configuration processing and rebuilding the application.

endmenu
